      "text": "This is a white ribbed camisole with a clean square neckline and simple thin straps, worn tucked into your trousers for a crisp finish."
    },
    {
      "n": "#346·32",
      "text": "You have light grey tapered trousers that fall just above the ankle; their relaxed fit and soft drape provide comfort while keeping a smart silhouette for the office."
    },
    {
      "n": "#140·04",
      "text": "This is an olive-green quilted puffer coat with a large hood lined in white, offering long insulation against the cold and snowy weather you face today."
    },
    {
      "n": "#31·19",
      "text": "These are beige cowboy boots made of nappa nubuck leather, featuring a decorative stitched yoke on the shaft, a sturdy block heel, and a pointed toe for an elegant yet grounded look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#7·40",
      "text": "This is a structured navy blue tote bag crafted from pebbled leather with top handles and a secure zippered opening on the side, perfect for carrying your essentials to work."
    }
  ],
  "text": "You have put together an exceptionally composed look that bridges office decorum with winter resilience. The crisp white camisole and light grey trousers create a clean, neutral foundation that feels professional without being rigid, while the olive-green puffer coat adds a sophisticated layer of warmth perfectly suited for -15 degrees and snowy conditions. The beige boots introduce a touch of western heritage that elevates the silhouette above standard work footwear, preventing your outfit from feeling too monotonous during long days on the move. This combination respects the formality required at work while acknowledging the harsh weather outside, ensuring you stay stylishly protected. The deep navy tote brings a grounded contrast to the lighter upper half and anchors the entire ensemble with its substantial presence.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "With the coat open, the white camisole and grey trousers show off your clean lines while you move between tasks, and when temperatures drop, zip it up to layer everything together comfortably."
  ],
